{"id":"u121","kelas":"toeic","no":8,"judul":"Kosakata Bisnis dan Tes Mini","title":"TOEIC Business Vocabulary and Mini Test","emoji":"🏆","ringkas":"Kosakata kantor, keuangan, perjalanan, dan tes mini campuran","ready":true,"goals":["mempelajari **kosakata kantor, keuangan, dan perjalanan** yang sering muncul di TOEIC","mengenali kata melalui **arti, ejaan, dan pendengaran**","mengerjakan **tes mini campuran** Part 2, 3, 5, 6, dan 7","menentukan bagian TOEIC yang perlu diperkuat"],"lesson":[{"t":"intro","text":"Kosakata bisnis muncul di semua bagian TOEIC. Pelajari tiga kelompok berikut, lalu kerjakan **tes mini** campuran di akhir latihan untuk melihat kemajuanmu."},{"t":"vocab","title":"1. Kantor dan SDM","items":[{"en":"employee","id":"karyawan","ex":"Each employee has a badge."},{"en":"employer","id":"pemberi kerja","ex":"The employer pays salaries."},{"en":"colleague","id":"rekan kerja","ex":"My colleague helped me."},{"en":"manager","id":"manajer","ex":"The manager called a meeting."},{"en":"department","id":"departemen","ex":"She works in the sales department."},{"en":"resume","id":"riwayat hidup","ex":"Send your resume to the office."},{"en":"interview","id":"wawancara","ex":"The interview starts at ten."},{"en":"promotion","id":"kenaikan jabatan","ex":"He got a promotion last year."}]},{"t":"vocab","title":"2. Keuangan dan penjualan","items":[{"en":"budget","id":"anggaran","ex":"The budget is too small."},{"en":"invoice","id":"faktur / tagihan","ex":"Please send the invoice."},{"en":"profit","id":"keuntungan","ex":"The company made a profit."},{"en":"revenue","id":"pendapatan","ex":"Revenue rose this year."},{"en":"expense","id":"pengeluaran","ex":"Travel is a big expense."},{"en":"customer","id":"pelanggan","ex":"The customer wants a refund."},{"en":"discount","id":"potongan harga","ex":"There is a discount today."},{"en":"receipt","id":"struk","ex":"Keep the receipt."}]},{"t":"vocab","title":"3. Perjalanan dan rapat","items":[{"en":"schedule","id":"jadwal","ex":"Check the schedule."},{"en":"agenda","id":"agenda rapat","ex":"The agenda has five items."},{"en":"itinerary","id":"rencana perjalanan","ex":"The itinerary includes two cities."},{"en":"reservation","id":"reservasi","ex":"I made a reservation at the hotel."},{"en":"deadline","id":"tenggat","ex":"The deadline is Friday."},{"en":"conference","id":"konferensi","ex":"The conference is in Jakarta."},{"en":"delay","id":"keterlambatan","ex":"There is a delay."},{"en":"luggage","id":"bagasi","ex":"Put your luggage here."}]},{"t":"dialog","title":"Dialog: Di kantor","lines":[{"who":"Mr. Adi","en":"Good morning. Do you have the invoice for the conference?","id":"Selamat pagi. Apakah kamu punya faktur untuk konferensi itu?"},{"who":"Ms. Sari","en":"Yes, but the budget is almost finished.","id":"Ya, tetapi anggarannya hampir habis."},{"who":"Mr. Adi","en":"What is the deadline for the report?","id":"Apa tenggat untuk laporannya?"},{"who":"Ms. Sari","en":"Friday. I will send the schedule today.","id":"Jumat. Aku akan mengirim jadwalnya hari ini."},{"who":"Mr. Adi","en":"Great. Please check the hotel reservation too.","id":"Bagus. Tolong periksa reservasi hotel juga."},{"who":"Ms. Sari","en":"Of course.","id":"Tentu."}]},{"t":"tip","title":"Cara menghafal","text":"Buat kartu kata dengan satu kata bisnis per hari dan satu kalimat contohmu sendiri tentang pekerjaanmu. Ulangi kartu lama tiap akhir pekan."},{"t":"summary","items":["Kantor dan SDM: [[employee]], [[employer]], [[colleague]], [[manager]], [[department]], [[resume]].","Keuangan dan penjualan: [[budget]], [[invoice]], [[profit]], [[revenue]], [[expense]], [[customer]].","Perjalanan dan rapat: [[schedule]], [[agenda]], [[itinerary]], [[reservation]], [[deadline]], [[conference]]."]}],"practice":[{"type":"mcq","q":"Apa arti \"employee\"?","options":["karyawan","manajer","kenaikan jabatan","reservasi"],"answer":0,"exp":"employee = karyawan.","k":"9d7252c9"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kata Inggris untuk \"karyawan\" adalah..."