an keuangan","Kartu identitas","Daftar belanja"],"answer":0,"exp":"Time sheets. Jawaban yang tepat: **Lembar jam kerja**.","k":"fdc8e0ff"},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Apa masalahnya?","say":"Hello, I'd like to book a meeting room for Thursday afternoon. Unfortunately, the large room is already taken. The small room is free from two to four. That's fine. I'll take it.","options":["Ruang besar sudah dipesan","Proyektor rusak","Ruangan terlalu kecil","Hari Kamis libur"],"answer":0,"exp":"Large room taken.","k":"b6e2ea0d"},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Tombol apa untuk reservasi hotel?","say":"Thank you for calling Blue Sky Travel. Our office hours are Monday to Friday from nine to five. If you wish to book a flight, press one. For hotel reservations, press two. To speak with an agent, press three.","options":["Dua","Satu","Tiga","Empat"],"answer":0,"exp":"Press two. Jawaban yang tepat: **Dua**.","k":"05396d51"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Part 5. The report ___ you sent was very useful.","options":["that","who","whose","what"],"answer":0,"exp":"Benda → that.","k":"c1f00981"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Part 5. He is responsible ___ the budget.","options":["for","to","at","with"],"answer":0,"exp":"Responsible for.","k":"2db61f29"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Part 5. Please submit the form ___.","options":["immediately","immediate","immediacy","immediateness"],"answer":0,"exp":"Kata keterangan di akhir.","k":"b7780215"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Part 5. The product is expensive, ___ many customers still buy it.","options":["but","because","unless","or"],"answer":0,"exp":"Kontras → but.","k":"28eea285"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Part 5. There are ___ chairs in the room.","options":["several","much","little","a little"],"answer":0,"exp":"Chairs terhitung jamak → several.","k":"26dd048a"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Part 5. You can pay by cash ___ by credit card.","options":["or","but","so","yet"],"answer":0,"exp":"Pilihan → or.","k":"c63f7d48"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Part 5. ___ the weather was bad, the event went ahead.","options":["Although","Because","Unless","So"],"answer":0,"exp":"Kontras → although.","k":"0278777a"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Part 5. The employees finished ___ work early.","options":["their","them","they","theirs"],"answer":0,"exp":"Sebelum benda → their.","k":"0c9c2380"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Part 5. Please ___ your seat belt during the flight.","options":["fasten","fill","faint","found"],"answer":0,"exp":"Fasten the seat belt.","k":"b9463caf"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Part 5. She was ___ to the position of director.","options":["promoted","produced","promised","protected"],"answer":0,"exp":"Promoted to. Jawaban yang tepat: **promoted**.","k":"bcf702ee"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Part 5. The store is offering a ten percent ___ on all items.","options":["discount","discuss","display","disaster"],"answer":0,"exp":"Discount = potongan.","k":"11d5511a"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Part 5. The new employee will ___ the team on Monday.","options":["join","joke","jump","judge"],"answer":0,"exp":"Join the team.","k":"10865a21"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Part 5. All employees must ___ with the safety rules.","options":["comply","complete","compare","compete"],"answer":0,"exp":"Comply with. Jawaban yang tepat: **comply**.","k":"3c08e8e6"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Part 5. The company's ___ rose by ten percent this year.","options":["revenue","reverse","review","remedy"],"answer":0,"exp":"Revenue = pendapatan.","k":"6d3def5d"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Part 6 (email). Pilih jawaban untuk bagian kosong:  Dear Mr. Adi, Thank you for your order. We are pleased to inform you that your package has been shipped. It will arrive at your address within three working days. ___ contact our customer service team if you have any questions. [...] We look forward to serving you again. Sincerely, Blue Sky Store","options":["Please","Although","Unless","Because"],"answer":0,"exp":"Permintaan sopan.","k":"3fe89925"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Part 6 (pengumuman). Pilih jawaban untuk bagian kosong:  NOTICE: The office will be closed on Monday be